ht create enough force to do a bigger jump if you're on it..?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006350/extras/d011cd554b97776c57a820a572542453.poster.avif?t=1743212843\" width=384 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006350/extras/d011cd554b97776c57a820a572542453.webm?t=1743212843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006350/extras/d011cd554b97776c57a820a572542453.mp4?t=1743212843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Enemies layered on top won't stand a chance against it!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006350/extras/842f9f729b4419989346239cc56c6d99.poster.avif?t=1743212843\" width=384 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006350/extras/842f9f729b4419989346239cc56c6d99.webm?t=1743212843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006350/extras/842f9f729b4419989346239cc56c6d99.mp4?t=1743212843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Estimated total play time</h2>2 and a half hours - 3 hours<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006350/extras/90aec4e6e2507854e4320d31d80c5741.poster.avif?t=1743212843\" width=384 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006350/extras/90aec4e6e2507854e4320d31d80c5741.webm?t=1743212843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006350/extras/90aec4e6e2507854e